### ============================================
### 邮件系统模块测试 (vellastra-mail :8092)
### ============================================

### 1. 订阅（发送确认邮件）
POST http://localhost:8080/mail/subscribers?email=user@example.com&name=张三
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 2. 确认订阅（邮件链接 token）
GET http://localhost:8080/mail/subscribers/confirm?token=replace-with-confirm-token

### 3. 退订（邮件链接 token）
GET http://localhost:8080/mail/subscribers/unsubscribe?token=replace-with-unsubscribe-token

### 4. 订阅者分页列表
GET http://localhost:8080/mail/subscribers?current=1&size=10&status=confirmed
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 5. 已确认订阅者数量
GET http://localhost:8080/mail/subscribers/count
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ========== 模板管理 ==========

### 6. 模板分页
GET http://localhost:8080/mail/templates?current=1&size=10
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 7. 创建模板
# @name createTemplate
POST http://localhost:8080/mail/templates
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "欢迎邮件",
  "code": "welcome",
  "subject": "欢迎加入 {{username}}",
  "content": "<h3>你好 {{username}}</h3><p>感谢订阅！</p>",
  "createdBy": "admin"
}

> {% client.global.set("templateId", response.body.data); %}

### 8. 模板详情
GET http://localhost:8080/mail/templates/{{templateId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 9. 模板预览
POST http://localhost:8080/mail/templates/{{templateId}}/preview
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "张三"
}

### 10. 更新模板
PUT http://localhost:8080/mail/templates/{{templateId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "欢迎邮件V2",
  "subject": "欢迎加入 {{username}} 社区",
  "content": "<h3>你好 {{username}}</h3><p>欢迎加入！</p>",
  "status": "active"
}

### 11. 删除模板
DELETE http://localhost:8080/mail/templates/{{templateId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ========== 发送与追踪 ==========

### 12. 单封发送
POST http://localhost:8080/mail/send/single?to=user@example.com&templateCode=welcome
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "张三"
}

> {% client.global.set("sendLogId", response.body.data); %}

### 13. 批量发送
POST http://localhost:8080/mail/send/batch?templateCode=welcome
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

[
  "user1@example.com",
  "user2@example.com"
]

### 14. 发送记录分页
GET http://localhost:8080/mail/send/logs?current=1&size=10&status=&batchNo=
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 15. 重试失败邮件
POST http://localhost:8080/mail/send/{{sendLogId}}/retry
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 16. 标记退信
POST http://localhost:8080/mail/send/{{sendLogId}}/bounce?reason=mailbox-full
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 17. 打开追踪（透明像素）
GET http://localhost:8080/mail/track/open/{{sendLogId}}

### 18. 点击追踪（302 跳转）
GET http://localhost:8080/mail/track/click/{{sendLogId}}?url=https://example.com
